Description: Include cstdint before using fixed-width integer types
 Newer C++ toolchains no longer provide uint8_t, uint16_t, and uint32_t
 transitively through the other standard library headers used by ThorVG.
Author: Texas Instruments
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-08-14

--- a/lv_port_linux/lvgl/src/libs/thorvg/thorvg.h
+++ b/lv_port_linux/lvgl/src/libs/thorvg/thorvg.h
@@ -10,6 +10,7 @@
 #if LV_USE_THORVG_INTERNAL
 #define TVG_BUILD 1
 
+#include <cstdint>
 
 #include <functional>
 #include <memory>
